ritical","due":"2024-10-28","description":"SOW is not valid. Please submit a SOW along with certified supporting evidence in order to support the business.","notes":null},{"title":"QPA/2024/01830 - Todd Poindexter - PHDF","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-10-28","description":"The PHDF must be filled out, signed and verified digitally. Please resubmit.","notes":null},{"title":"QPA/2024/01830 - Todd Poindexter - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-10-28","description":"SOW is not valid. Please submit a SOW along with certified supporting evidence in order to support the business.","notes":null},{"title":"QPA/2024/01832 - Gabriel Fortuny Requa - Proof of address","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-10-28","description":"Kindly note that the proof of address is not valid. We would require an actual utility bill that clearly displays the address.","notes":null},{"title":"Corporate Structure","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-07-17","description":"The corporate structure does not align with the share ledgers provided, which indicate two more interstitial companies above SMTM Global LLC. Kindly amend and resubmit corporate structure signed by the director and duly dated. Signatory should be identifiable","notes":null},{"title":"Local director","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-07-17","description":"No local director appointed. At least one local executive director is required. Appoint a local director (TSP) and submit the PHDF and enclosures of its representatives. Resubmit an updated director's register of the applicant company following the said appointment","notes":null},{"title":"Financial Statements","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-07-17","description":"Resubmit the FS submitted for 2022 duly signed and approved by the director. Submit also FS 2023 and signed financials in whatever form for year ending 2024","